        <mxCell id="Y7xfA3IQ6NoBs-OmP8Ok-1" value="&lt;div&gt;- v1.12: calls to hardware&amp;nbsp; (usually) happen directly inside Handle Command.vi override inside Instrument:process.vi&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- v1.13:&amp;nbsp; calls to hardware should happen inside Instrument.Child:process.vi. Handle Command acts as a message broker.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- v1.14: hardware gets its own HAL:process. This should enable better reuse. Handle Command-&amp;gt;Instrument:process.vi can still act as message broker (and forward to Instrument.Child:process.vi for further processing)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
